{"id":58237,"date":"2026-08-09T15:14:55","date_gmt":"2026-08-09T14:14:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=58237"},"modified":"2026-08-26T18:04:17","modified_gmt":"2026-08-26T17:04:17","slug":"meia-maratona-cascais-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-cascais-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Cascais 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: Descri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Montepio Meia Maratona de Cascais 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    A <strong>Montepio Meia Maratona de Cascais 2027<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das corridas de estrada mais deslumbrantes de Portugal, organizada pela HMS Sports em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Cascais. Com a Ba\u00eda de Cascais como cen\u00e1rio de partida e chegada, a prova convida os atletas a correrem lado a lado com o Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico ao longo da prestigiada Estrada do Guincho e da costa estorilense.\n  <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O evento engloba a cl\u00e1ssica dist\u00e2ncia de Meia Maratona (21,0975 km), os 10 Km de Cascais, os 5 Km e a Corrida das Crian\u00e7as no dia anterior. Prepara os teus ritmos de prova com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre as melhores dicas no nosso <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">guia de Meia Maratona<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: Ficha T\u00e9cnica --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica do <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Evento<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data Oficial:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">6 e 7 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udccd Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Ba\u00eda de Cascais (Passeio Dom Lu\u00eds I)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">21,0975 km, 10 km, 5 km e Corrida das Crian\u00e7as<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Tipo de Piso:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Asfalto cont\u00ednuo costeiro (Estrada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Organiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">HMS Sports \/ C\u00e2mara Municipal de Cascais<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: Geometria da Prova --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Percurso<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n    O percurso da Meia Maratona tem in\u00edcio no Passeio Dom Lu\u00eds I, na Ba\u00eda de Cascais, seguindo pela Avenida da Rep\u00fablica e pela emblem\u00e1tica Estrada do Guincho at\u00e9 junto \u00e0 Praia do Guincho, onde \u00e9 efetuado o retorno com regresso panor\u00e2mico \u00e0 Ba\u00eda.\n  <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 maioritariamente plano com ligeiras ondula\u00e7\u00f5es junto \u00e0 costa, exposto \u00e0 brisa atlantica e com apoio constante do p\u00fablico ao longo da linha de mar.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: Banner Calculadora --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.05) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcula o teu Pace para a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Meia de Cascais<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Descobre a tua estimativa de tempo e planeia o ritmo ideal para a prova.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #1E1B4B; font-weight: 800; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Abrir Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: Onde Ficar --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Cascais e o Estoril contam com uma vasta oferta de hotelaria de excelente qualidade, a poucos minutos a p\u00e9 do Passeio Dom Lu\u00eds I. Recomenda-se a reserva no centro de Cascais ou junto \u00e0 esta\u00e7\u00e3o de comboios para facilitar a desloca\u00e7\u00e3o na manh\u00e3 da prova.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: Sobre o Local & Gastronomia --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre Cascais &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Famosa pelas suas praias, marina cosmopolita e vila hist\u00f3rica, Cascais \u00e9 um dos destinos tur\u00edsticos mais prestigiados de Portugal. Ap\u00f3s cortar a meta, desfruta do peixe fresco, mariscos da costa e das famosas Nozes de Cascais nos restaurantes da Ba\u00eda.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: Perguntas Frequentes --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-faq-section\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h3>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona de Cascais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se nos dias 6 e 7 de Fevereiro de 2027 (Corrida das Crian\u00e7as a 6 Fev; Meia Maratona, 10k e 5k a 7 Fev).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais s\u00e3o efetuadas no portal da HMS Sports em meiamaratonadecascais.pt.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e tempos por escal\u00e3o s\u00e3o publicados na p\u00e1gina oficial da HMS Sports e divulgados no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":48422,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[41,672,27,28,478,624],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-58237","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-cascais-lisboa","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/618800958_1336756615163651_3311545670728470793_n.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/58237","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=58237"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/ww